    "created_at": "2017-05-01T21:31:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-05-01T21:31:24Z",
    "body": "Do we see use cases where there would be a lot of trial and error on ImageBitmap creation? Like: try this setting, then try this other one, etc, etc? \r\n\r\nCreating a single ImageBitmap that fails because what you want is not supported, is not that complex. But if use cases are closer to webGL (i.e., you may want something but if it doesn't exist you are still fine) then I can see the need for a new API.",
